    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you interested and want to support us, Don't forget to wishlist and follow!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/c33d8633ee97dbe47a526cbf8dd83b45.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/388869c4c99dbb894df7e0831541fd67.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge. Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/9d39da558592b7b0e11d513c8ed22025.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/c9d4adcab361891c1cb864c64f3bbe95.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/fb4f490ed0f1adb4480a1c3771475503.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/7a44c55770b22f3d69f112301283a912.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/2d8a98ad60bed345e381a9859ee4339a.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/5246b7b4be65052ab8c93fd7b2990aa4.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/388869c4c99dbb894df7e0831541fd67.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A third-person survival horror game. The story follows a girl with psychic power who tries to escape a secret laboratory swarming with grotesque and monstrous creatures. Uncover the truth behind the incident and embark on a thrilling adventure that'll keep you on the edge. Explore a sci-fi setting filled with mystery and danger, where a terror is waiting to attack you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/9d39da558592b7b0e11d513c8ed22025.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/c9d4adcab361891c1cb864c64f3bbe95.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as Elixia, a mysterious girl with unique psychic powers useful in combat and puzzle-solving. Wield a variety of psychic abilities to survive and overcome challenges. Unleash a forceful blast with the power of a bullet, use telekinesis to manipulate and hurl objects at high speed, cause enemies to implode under immense pressure, and create barriers to block and counter attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/fb4f490ed0f1adb4480a1c3771475503.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/7a44c55770b22f3d69f112301283a912.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against dreadful stalkers\u2014twisted creations born from sinister experiments. These relentless creatures possess unique abilities, making them formidable foes who will stop at nothing to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/2d8a98ad60bed345e381a9859ee4339a.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018390/extras/5246b7b4be65052ab8c93fd7b2990aa4.avif?t=1755227764\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience a fresh take on survival horror that blends classic mechanics like limited resources, backtracking, and puzzle-solving with a dynamic environment, allowing you to adapt and respond to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge your own path to survival\u2014whether through intense combat or stealthy evasion. Navigate and interact with a mysterious sci-fi laboratory, exploring freely as you uncover its dangers and secrets.</p>",
